 Watchers cannot touch the family of a Senator.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","004","idea","jushou"],["say","avg3_100","In that case, if you just stop being a Night Watcher of Filanis for a moment... Problem solved, right?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","010","question",null,-0.32,1.45,null,"lengzhan","OutQuad",0.35],["say","avg1_162","What do you mean?",0,""],["w",0.35],["mrt",1,"z","004","star","jushou"],["say","avg3_100","It's simple. The slavers aren't attacked by a Night Watcher, they're ambushed by passing bandits. Out here in the Wilds, getting targeted by bandits is perfectly normal.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","004","speechless",null,-0.25,1.35,null,null,"OutSine",1.0],["say","avg1_162","True, but what are the odds of bandits conveniently showing up right now...==W== Wait, don't tell me...",0,""],["w",0.75],["ctl","avg1_162","a","007","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.45],["goon"],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"OutSine",0.5,null,null,null],["mrt",1,"z","018",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Exactly. We are the bandits!",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg1_162","a","022","flurry",null,null,null,null,"niunie","OutSine",0.45],["say","avg1_162","We? A Night Watcher masquerading as a bandit... That's completely crossing a line. It stains the honor of the Night Watchers.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","012","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","So you're just going to stand by and watch?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","017","vexation",null,null,1.32,null,null,"OutQuad",1.0],["say","avg1_162","I...",0,""],["w",0.8],["mrt",1,"z","012",null,null],["say","avg3_100","I think ignoring your own conscience here would be a much bigger stain on your honor.",1,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.16,"OutQuart",0.5,null,null,null],["se","se_019"],["ctl","avg1_162","a","010",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["w",